    <releases>
      <release version="0.9.6" date="2026-08-18">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Epoch5427/Commodus/releases/tag/v0.9.6</url>
      <description translate="no">
        <p>Backend Robustness Improvements + Minor UX Improvements</p>
        <ul>
          <li>When selecting a major and semester and one or all of the required courses is missing the user is presented with a popup</li>
          <li>The courses scraper doesn't delete the database if it encounters an error</li>
          <li>The courses scraper is more resilient to errors now</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
      <release version="0.9.5" date="2026-06-30">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Epoch5427/Commodus/releases/tag/v0.9.5</url>
      <description translate="no">
        <p>New Features + Major Bug Fixes and UX Improvements</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed the filter pop up not working for courses with a lot of sections or instructors</li>
          <li>Reworked the filters dialog to be a lot smaller and smarter. It now dynamically removes useless elements</li>
          <li>Fixed glitches that occurred as a result of using the generate shortcut before the fetch function was complete</li>
          <li>Made it so selected courses appear at the top of the courses listbox and reschedule listbox</li>
          <li>The reschedule function was reworked to use toggle buttons and checkboxes rather than drop downs in order to be more intuitive</li>
          <li>Fixed the right arrow being sensitive even when only 1 schedule is generated</li>
          <li>Fixed a longstanding bug in schedule generation for tutorials and labs with multiple meeting times</li>
          <li>Sidebar course filters now disappear when no meaningful options are found using the same logic for the pop up</li>
          <li>Added the ability to specify a specific time to be a gap for a specific day or all days</li>
          <li>The course selection screen now displays ellipsized course title as well as course code with full support for search</li>
          <li>The time boundary and specify gap functions now use an enable switch on the expander row rather than being neutralized by setting the time to 00:00</li>
          <li>Added the ability to specify two priorities rather than one through a new composite score calculation</li>
          <li>Added the ability to simply select major and semester rather than selecting courses manually</li>
          <li>Made improvements on the course fetcher in the backend resulting in automated updates for the courses database</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
      <release version="0.9.4" date="2026-06-29">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Epoch5427/Commodus/releases/tag/v0.9.4</url>
      <description translate="no">
        <p>UX reworks + some minor bug fixes + shortcuts</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed the no schedules found screen</li>
          <li>The first time you open the app now shows the "start typing to search" screen and not the "no results found" screen</li>
          <li>The searchbar opens automatically when entering the courses page now</li>
          <li>Implemented a couple of changes to accommodate the windows port</li>
          <li>Added shortcuts for a lot of functions as well as a shortcuts dialog</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.9.3" date="2026-06-28">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Epoch5427/Commodus/releases/tag/v0.9.3</url>
      <description translate="no">
        <p>Quality of Life Update</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Added a new state for the network status indicator to explicitly show that the app is using a cached version of the DB</li>
          <li>Removed the load data button and made it a debug option in the preferences in order not to confuse users</li>
          <li>Added white outlines to the icon to make it look better in dark mode</li>
          <li>Added a back button to the schedules page</li>
          <li>Replaced connection failed popups with a banner</li>
          <li>reworked the backend to make it return schedules in batches removing any lag prior experienced from clicking generate</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.9.2" date="2026-06-26">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Epoch5427/Commodus/releases/tag/v0.9.2</url>
      <description translate="no">
        <p>Initial Release of Commodus</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Blazing-fast C++ backtrack-based scheduling solver backend.</li>
          <li>Modern GTK4 and Libadwaita user interface.</li>
          <li>Interactive, highly polished timeline with horizontal card expanding and smart height-scaling.</li>
          <li>On-the-fly "Compare and Reschedule" dialog to selectively lock down sections.</li>
          <li>Automatic, asynchronous remote database downloading from GitHub with local caching.</li>
          <li>Comprehensive, persistent offline state saving and configuration.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
  </releases>

</component>
